"title": "Wafilipi 1:1–11",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "50001001-50001011",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108102\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Paulo</data> alikuwa mtu wa kwanza kuwaambia watu wa <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108126\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Filipi</data> kuhusu <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108219\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Yesu</data>. Hadithi kuhusu hili imeandikwa katika Matendo sura ya 16.</p><p>Baada ya Paulo kuondoka Filipi, viongozi wengine na <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108100\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">mashemasi</data> waliendelea kusaidia <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108096\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">kanisa</data>.</p><p>Maombi ya <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108227\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Paulo</data> kwa <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108077\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">waumini</data> wa Wafilipi yalikuwa yamejaa furaha. Alibaki marafiki wa karibu sana nao. Walikuwa washirika wake katika kueneza <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108043\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">habari njema</data> kuhusu Yesu.</p><p><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108199\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Mungu</data> alifanya kazi katika <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108419\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">mioyo</data> ya waumini na kufanya mema kupitia wao. Paulo aliwaombea waendelee kuishi jinsi Yesu alivyofundisha watu kuishi. Kisha watakuwa tayari kwa <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108065\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">kurudi kwa Yesu</data>.</p>",
